  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Unit: YM-000026, joint Gaussian law and masked coordinates for the
    reader family.

    <item>Status: draft; independent source and mathematical review remain
    required.

    <item>Imported Lean revision: <verbatim|3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464>.

    <item>Manuscript: <verbatim|manuscript/existence/all-arity-reader-gaussian-model.tex>.

    <item>Scope: identify the exact common sample law, its pushed Gaussian
    covariance from active input coordinates to every retained incidence
    coordinate, the short-kernel covariance bound, and the masked coordinate
    comparison on every admissible reader patch. This is an auxiliary leading
    law, not the full interacting block law.
  </itemize-minus>

